rl_r2_200 (r2 iteration 200), on games never used anywhere: head to head against az-v1's best agent (net 357 + 400-simulation search) 55.0% of 2,000 games (52.8-57.1%); against the GA base 70.3% of 2,000 new games (68.2-72.2%), where az-v1's best scores 69.0% on the very same games. On az-v1's goal games: 70.6% vs the GA base (az-v1's best 69.7%), 80.1% vs the three bots (75.6%). Goal checks along r2: head to head 54.3% / 55.4% / 54.6% / 54.6% at iterations 50 / 100 / 150 / 200; vs GA 68.0% \u2192 70.6%."},{"t":"2026-11-17 22:03:09","kind":"decision","title":"Release: models/rl_r2_200","text":"r2's net 200, confirmed on 4,000 new games, saved as models/rl_r2_200.npy (+ .pt). Chosen at a goal-check iteration, before the confirmation, so the confirmation numbers are not selected.","rejected":"a later or best-evaluation checkpoint (selection by evaluation would flatter it)"},{"kind":"goal_check","t":"2026-11-17 21:56:11","label":"r2 iteration 225","note":"","policy":"runs/r2/net_225.npy","n":1000,"score":0.6985,"ci":[0.6693,0.7261],"big_money":0.8875,"smithy_bm":0.78,"witch_bm":0.6525,"secs":2,"replay":null},{"kind":"goal_check","t":"2026-11-17 21:43:29","label":"r2 iteration 200","note":"","policy":"runs/r2/net_200.npy","n":1000,"score":0.7055,"ci":[0.6765,0.7329],"big_money":0.9,"smithy_bm":0.81,"witch_bm":0.6925,"secs":101,"vs_az":0.5455,"vs_az_ci":[0.5145,0.5761],"vs_az_n":1000,"replay":null},{"kind":"goal_check","t":"2026-11-17 21:32:18","label":"r2 iteration 175","note":"","policy":"runs/r2/net_175.npy","n":1000,"score":0.7125,"ci":[0.6837,0.7397],"big_money":0.92,"smithy_bm":0.805,"witch_bm":0.66,"secs":1,"replay":null},{"kind":"goal_check","t":"2026-11-17 21:23:04","label":"r2 iteration 150","note":"","policy":"runs/r2/net_150.npy","n":1000,"score":0.7005,"ci":[0.6714,0.7281],"big_money":0.895,"smithy_bm":0.795,"witch_bm":0.6775,"secs":104,"vs_az":0.5455,"vs_az_ci":[0.5145,0.5761],"vs_az_n":1000,"replay":null},{"kind":"goal_check","t":"2026-11-17 21:12:07","label":"r2 iteration 125","note":"","policy":"runs/r2/net_125.npy","n":1000,"score":0.698,"ci":[0.6688,0.7257],"big_money":0.89,"smithy_bm":0.775,"witch_bm":0.6625,"secs":1,"replay":null},{"kind":"goal_check","t":"2026-11-17 21:01:45","label":"r2 iteration 100","note":"","policy":"runs/r2/net_100.npy","n":1000,"score":0.681,"ci":[0.6515,0.7091],"big_money":0.875,"smithy_bm":0.735,"witch_bm":0.6525,"secs":99,"vs_az":0.554,"vs_az_ci":[0.523,0.5845],"vs_az_n":1000,"replay":null},{"kind":"goal_check","t":"2026-11-17 20:51:33","label":"r2 iteration 75","note":"","policy":"runs/r2/net_75.npy","n":1000,"score":0.686,"ci":[0.6566,0.714],"big_money":0.8675,"smithy_bm":0.7475,"witch_bm":0.64,"secs":1,"replay":null},{"t":"2026-11-17 20:43:24","kind":"journal","title":"r2 iteration 50: first win head to head against az-v1's best","text":"1,000 fresh games against az-v1's best agent (net 357 + 400-simulation search): 54.3% (51.2-57.3%), the whole interval above 50%. Against the GA base on az-v1's goal games: 68.0% (az-v1's best: 69.7% on the same games); bots 78.3%. In training (sampling) it scores ~52-55% against az-v1's net and ~52-58% against its search. Half of the goal is met; the other half (above 70% vs the GA) not yet."},{"kind":"goal_check","t":"2026-11-17 20:42:50","label":"r2 iteration 50","note":"","policy":"runs/r2/net_50.npy","n":1000,"score":0.68,"ci":[0.6504,0.7082],"big_money":0.8775,"smithy_bm":0.7825,"witch_bm":0.69,"secs":97,"vs_az":0.5425,"vs_az_ci":[0.5115,0.5732],"vs_az_n":1000,"replay":null},{"kind":"goal_check","t":"2026-11-17 20:31:41","label":"r2 iteration 25","note":"","policy":"runs/r2/net_25.npy","n":1000,"score":0.6805,"ci":[0.651,0.7087],"big_money":0.8725,"smithy_bm":0.7675,"witch_bm":0.6525,"secs":1,"replay":null},{"t":"2026-11-17 20:22:13","kind":"journal","title":"Run r1 stopped at iteration 203: level with az-v1's best, no longer climbing","text":"Goal checks vs the GA base: 67.3% (100), 66.4% (125), 68.0% (150), 67.2% (175), 68.4% (200). Head to head vs az-v1's best: 49.2% (100), 49.4% (200). Bots recovered to 76.8%. The league never contains the agent to beat."},{"t":"2026-11-17 20:22:13","kind":"decision","title":"Run r2: az-v1's agent joins the league","text":"From r1's newest net. League: 30% GA base, 15% bots, 15% past snapshots, 15% az-v1's best net without search (its buys, GA actions; fast), 5% az-v1's best agent with 400-simulation search (~0.5 s a game), 20% itself. Head-to-head checks every 50 iterations.","rejected":"keeping r1's league (flat at ~68% / ~49% for 100 iterations)"},{"kind":"goal_check","t":"2026-11-17 20:21:31","label":"r1 iteration 200","note":"","policy":"runs/r1/net_200.npy","n":1000,"score":0.684,"ci":[0.6545,0.7121],"big_money":0.865,"smithy_bm":0.775,"witch_bm":0.665,"secs":116,"vs_az":0.494,"vs_az_ci":[0.4631,0.525],"vs_az_n":1000,"replay":null},{"kind":"goal_check","t":"2026-11-17 20:16:04","label":"r1 iteration 175","note":"","policy":"runs/r1/net_175.npy","n":1000,"score":0.672,"ci":[0.6423,0.7004],"big_money":0.86,"smithy_bm":0.755,"witch_bm":0.675,"secs":1,"replay":null},{"kind":"goal_check","t":"2026-11-17 20:11:36","label":"r1 iteration 150","note":"","policy":"runs/r1/net_150.npy","n":1000,"score":0.68,"ci":[0.6504,0.7082],"big_money":0.8525,"smithy_bm":0.7575,"witch_bm":0.655,"secs":1,"replay":null},{"kind":"goal_check","t":"2026-11-17 20:07:12","label":"r1 iteration 125","note":"","policy":"runs/r1/net_125.npy","n":1000,"score":0.664,"ci":[0.6341,0.6926],"big_money":0.8425,"smithy_bm":0.7,"witch_bm":0.62,"secs":1,"replay":null},{"t":"2026-11-17 20:03:09","kind":"decision","title":"Method: one network for every decision, behaviour cloning then PPO with a league","text":"Third method, deliberately unlike the GA (evolved rules) and az-v1 (tree search over buys): a 298-256-256-34 MLP answers all ~22 kinds of decision, imitates the GA genome first (1.08 M decisions, 98.5% agreement), then improves by PPO (clip 0.2, GAE lambda 0.95, entropy 0.01) against 40% GA base, 15% bots, 15% past snapshots, 30% itself. Runs in C inside the engine: 3 ms per game, so 3,000 games per ~10 s iteration.","rejected":"more search (az-v1 showed it saturates); evolution again; a value-only method (DQN) \u2014 PPO is the standard, stable choice for a large discrete action space with masking"},{"t":"2026-11-17 20:03:09","kind":"journal","title":"Iteration 100: level with az-v1's best agent after 25 minutes of RL","text":"Goal checks against the GA base (az-v1's 1,000 goal games): 59.6% (iteration 25), 63.6% (50), 65.3% (75), 67.3% (100); the imitating network started at 52% in the evaluation games. Head to head against az-v1's best agent (net 357 + 400-simulation search, 1,000 fresh games): 49.2% (46.1-52.3%). The bot scores slid from 74.8% to 71.5%: it specialises against the GA genome, its most frequent opponent."},{"t":"2026-11-17 20:03:09","kind":"journal","title":"Built the AZ seat check: az-v1's best agent scores 69.7% on the same 1,000 goal games inside this engine build (az-v1 measured 70.2%), so the two projects' numbers compare directly.","text":""},{"kind":"goal_check","t":"2026-11-17 20:02:46","label":"r1 iteration 100","note":"","policy":"runs/r1/net_100.npy","n":1000,"score":0.6725,"ci":[0.6428,0.7009],"big_money":0.8425,"smithy_bm":0.7275,"witch_bm":0.64,"secs":119,"vs_az":0.4915,"vs_az_ci":[0.4606,0.5225],"vs_az_n":1000,"replay":null},{"kind":"goal_check","t":"2026-11-17 19:56:09","label":"r1 iteration 75","note":"","policy":"runs/r1/net_75.npy","n":1000,"score":0.6525,"ci":[0.6225,0.6814],"big_money":0.8625,"smithy_bm":0.6625,"witch_bm":0.585,"secs":1,"replay":null},{"kind":"goal_check","t":"2026-11-17 19:51:54","label":"r1 iteration 50","note":"","policy":"runs/r1/net_50.npy","n":1000,"score":0.6355,"ci":[0.6052,0.6648],"big_money":0.8375,"smithy_bm":0.67,"witch_bm":0.6225,"secs":2,"replay":null},{"kind":"goal_check","t":"2026-11-17 19:47:44","label":"r1 iteration 25","note":"","policy":"runs/r1/net_25.npy","n":1000,"score":0.5955,"ci":[0.5648,0.6255],"big_money":0.8675,"smithy_bm":0.705,"witch_bm":0.6725,"secs":1,"replay":null}]